 been saying that I look old this whole time?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_22","text":"No, not at all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_23","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_24","text":"You think so?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_25","text":"Absolutely.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_26","text":"See?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_27","text":"I told you that's not what they meant.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_28","text":"I just forgot my graduating class badge,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_29","text":"so they couldn't tell what grade I was in.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_30","text":"You're overthinking this, Naga.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"tia","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_31","text":"No one could ever accuse you of being looking haggard ♥","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_32","text":"Please.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"naga","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_dazzlingpearl_03_33","